  "mobius_smoothing_status": "AF MediumPNT -> qualitative psi error -> M(x)=o(x) -> sum mu(n)/n -> 0 -> logMean -> 1. WeightedMobius proves exact twice-integration and residual identities, absolute Cesaro error -> 0, and uniform weighted smoothing away from u=0. WeightDerivatives supplies explicit first/second real derivatives and coefficient-sum bounds for ShiftWeights.weight. ShiftedMobius proves uniform L*S -> A*P(u/theta)+P'(u/theta)/theta for bounded complex shifts and u in [u0,U], u0>0; covers both witness and swapped reflected bidiscs. Entire shift dependence and Cauchy estimates with explicit outer-radius margin prove every normalized FiniteJet.jet limit uniformly, including values at (-B,-A) before reflection chain-rule signs. No quantitative Mobius rate, extra PNT premise, new axiom or toolchain change. ShiftedEndpoint supplies endpoint-safe bounds for the actual scaled coprime sums. Interior finite-head product errors and endpoint-window domination are now proved as specified below. The full arithmetic-weighted outer asymptotic, Feng terms, gcd main-term limit and zero counting remain open.",
