  },
  "coprime_product_status": "Exact shifted coprime convolution and product-safe Rankin tails are connected to actual sums. CoprimeHead identifies each fixed finite supported head uniformly in g, bounded complex shifts and u in [u0,U], u0>0. CoprimeApproximation supplies eps/r plus a Rankin tail envelopes and returns actual two-profile product errors to the harmonic g-average with an explicit eps and Q^(-1/4) bound. ShiftedEndpoint proves actual second-moment bounds including u=0. EndpointAverage proves actual_log_endpoint_bound: head harmonic mass H_Q^2*(L*delta+4) plus 2*H_floor(exp(L*U))*Q^(-1/4)*productConstant, times the squared profile cap. This is quantitative endpoint domination for the 1/g average, not yet the literal generalized-totient gcd weight. TotientWeight identifies eulerMass g 0=g/phi(g) and the zero-shift weight mu(g)^2/phi(g). Its harmonic asymptotic log x+O(1), shifted outer main-term identification, full Euler-factor limits, Feng terms and Wu counting are NOT proved. No new axiom, numerical optimization, toolchain change or publication."
